How to Run the Project
To run the project, open Command Prompt or PowerShell and go to the project folder:

cd "C:\Users\afrid\Documents\Codex\2026-05-18\https-www-silinexglobal-com-the-above"

Then start the PHP development server:

php -S localhost:8000

After that, open this URL in the browser:

http://localhost:8000


Important Note About the 404 Error
If you run this command from the wrong folder:

php -S localhost:8000

PHP will serve that current folder. If the folder does not contain index.php, the browser will show:

Not Found
The requested resource / was not found on this server.

To solve this, always run the command from the folder where index.php exists, or use the -t option:

php -S localhost:8000 -t "C:\Users\afrid\Documents\Codex\2026-05-18\https-www-silinexglobal-com-the-above"


